    ok 2 - <0/0> cmp 42
    ok 3 - <0/0> cmp -42
    ok 4 - <0/0> cmp Inf
    ok 5 - <0/0> cmp -Inf
    ok 6 -  NaN cmp <0/0>
    ok 7 -   42 cmp <0/0>
    ok 8 -  -42 cmp <0/0>
    ok 9 -  Inf cmp <0/0>
    ok 10 - -Inf cmp <0/0>
ok 57 - <0/0> (behaves like NaN)
