# Subtest: no precision loss in infix:<cmp> with Rational and Ints
    1..8
    ok 1 - Rat cmp Int
    ok 2 - Int cmp Rat
    ok 3 - Rat cmp Rat
    ok 4 - FatRat cmp Int
    ok 5 - Int    cmp FatRat
    ok 6 - FatRat cmp FatRat
    ok 7 - FatRat cmp Rat
    ok 8 - Rat    cmp FatRat
ok 63 - no precision loss in infix:<cmp> with Rational and Ints
